这只是在...
噢！

08:17.567 --> 08:20.500
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

08:20.567 --> 08:23.100
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:23.167 --> 08:26.167
Why did you have to go nuts
on company time, boy-o?
为什么你必须发疯
在公司时间，男孩？

08:26.233 --> 08:28.433
I'm gonna lose so much money.
我会损失很多钱。

08:28.500 --> 08:29.833
- I didn't go nuts, Mr. Krabs.
- 我没有发疯，蟹老板。

08:29.900 --> 08:31.433
They must've mistaken me
for someone else.
他们一定误会我了
为了别人。

08:31.500 --> 08:33.067
I'm innocent!
我是无辜的！

08:33.100 --> 08:34.367
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

08:34.433 --> 08:36.900
- Oh? Squeaky, squeaky?
- 哦？吱吱、吱吱？

08:36.967 --> 08:38.167
[growling]
[咆哮]

08:38.233 --> 08:40.500
- Save it for the judge, boy-o.
- 把它留给法官吧，小伙子。

08:40.567 --> 08:43.700
Come clean! Nobody else
even looks like you!
来干净吧！没有其他人
连长得都像你！

08:43.767 --> 08:45.233
[eerie swell]
[诡异的膨胀]

08:45.300 --> 08:47.100
Except that guy.
除了那个家伙。

08:47.167 --> 08:50.100
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:50.167 --> 08:54.267
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:54.333 --> 08:56.067
- [gasps]
- [growling]
- [喘气]
- [咆哮]

08:56.133 --> 08:58.067
Squeaky, squeaky!
Squeaky, squeaky!
吱吱，吱吱！
吱吱，吱吱！

08:58.133 --> 09:00.933
- Local scientists now believe
that the rampaging fry cook
- 当地科学家现在相信
那个狂暴的鱼苗做饭

09:01.067 --> 09:03.333
is actually
a prehistoric "cave sponge,"
实际上是
史前的“洞穴海绵”

09:03.400 --> 09:05.133
once thought to be extinct.
- Ah! Get him off!
一度被认为已经灭绝。
- 啊！把他放开！

09:05.200 --> 09:07.333
- See! I didn't
destroy any property!
- 看！我没有
摧毁任何财产！

09:07.400 --> 09:09.067
It was that Cave Sponge!
就是那个洞穴海绵！

09:09.100 --> 09:10.533
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:10.600 --> 09:12.800
- [sniffing]
- Aw. He's just lost and scared.
- [嗅嗅]
- 噢。他只是迷失和害怕。

09:12.867 --> 09:15.333
He just needs
another sponge to talk to.
他只需要
另一块可以交谈的海绵。

09:15.400 --> 09:16.800
- Shortly thereafter,
- 此后不久，

09:16.867 --> 09:19.167
Mr. Krabs and SpongeBob
went to City Hall
蟹老板和海绵宝宝
去了市政厅

09:19.233 --> 09:21.067
to confront the wild beast.
去对抗野兽。

09:21.100 --> 09:22.700
- We did?
- 我们做到了？

09:22.767 --> 09:23.767
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:23.833 --> 09:26.967
- [panicked grunting]
- [惊慌的咕哝声]

09:27.067 --> 09:28.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:28.700 --> 09:30.633
- Don't worry, officer.
I'm a fellow sponge.
- 别担心，警官。
我是一块海绵。

09:30.700 --> 09:32.167
He'll listen to me.
他会听我的。

09:32.233 --> 09:36.367
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:36.433 --> 09:37.533
- Unh?
- 呃？

09:37.600 --> 09:38.700
[sniffing]
- Ooh?
[嗅嗅]
- 哦？

09:38.767 --> 09:40.567
[giggles]
[sniffing]
[咯咯笑]
[嗅嗅]

09:40.633 --> 09:42.567
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

09:42.633 --> 09:44.167
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

09:44.233 --> 09:46.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:46.100 --> 09:47.367
- Unh.
- 嗯。

09:47.433 --> 09:49.233
Spongy Spongy.
海绵状的 海绵状的。

09:49.300 --> 09:50.567
- Oof!
- 噢！

09:50.633 --> 09:52.733
Now we're getting somewhere!
现在我们已经取得进展了！

09:52.800 --> 09:55.733
Sooo...can you please
go downstairs now
苏...可以请你吗
现在下楼去

09:55.800 --> 09:57.533
and turn yourself in
to the police?
并自首
报警？

09:57.600 --> 09:59.467
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:59.533 --> 10:02.000
- Hello!
- [growls]
- 你好！
- [咆哮]

10:02.067 --> 10:03.533
- Okay, Spongy Spongy.
- 好吧，海绵海绵。

10:03.600 --> 10:06.533
I respect that.
I'll leave you alone.
我尊重这一点。
我会让你独自一人。

10:06.600 --> 10:08.600
- [growls]
Uh.
- [咆哮]
呃。

10:08.667 --> 10:11.600
[happy grunting]
Oh!
[快乐的咕噜声]
哦！

10:11.667 --> 10:13.467
Squeaky, squeaky!
吱吱，吱吱！

10:13.533 --> 10:15.067
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:15.133 --> 10:16.467
- Oh, you like that, huh?
- 哦，你喜欢这样，是吗？

10:16.533 --> 10:18.467
[squeaking]
Ah!
[吱吱声]
啊！

10:18.533 --> 10:20.467
- [imitating grunts]
- [模仿咕噜声]

10:20.533 --> 10:22.267
[both squeaking]
[两者都吱吱作响]

10:22.333 --> 10:25.267
[upbeat crescendo]
[欢快的渐强]

10:25.333 --> 10:32.567
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:42.333 --> 10:47.000
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:47.067 --> 10:50.200
[all cheering and applauding]
- [whistling]
[大家欢呼和鼓掌]
- [吹口哨]

10:50.267 --> 10:51.800
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:51.867 --> 10:52.600
[thuds]
[重击声]

10:52.667 --> 10:55.600
- [happy grunting]
- [快乐的咕噜声]

10:55.667 --> 10:56.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:56.733 --> 10:59.667
[frustrated shouting]
[沮丧的喊叫]

10:59.733 --> 11:01.533
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:01.600 --> 11:03.133
- Spongy Spongy, wait!
- 海绵宝宝，等等！

11:03.200 --> 11:04.533
Wahh!
哇！

11:04.600 --> 11:07.533
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

11:07.600 --> 11:08.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

11:08.733 --> 11:10.667
Well, I talked him down.
好吧，我说服了他。

11:10.733 --> 11:12.067
Hooray.
万岁。

11:12.133 --> 11:14.933
Oh, please don't put
Spongy Spongy in jail!
哦，请不要放
海绵宝宝进监狱啦！

11:15.067 --> 11:17.333
- Nobody's gonna
put him in jail son.
- 没人会
儿子，把他关进监狱。

11:17.400 --> 11:21.533
He just saved the town millions
by demolishing city hall.
他刚刚为小镇拯救了数百万美元
通过拆除市政厅。

11:21.600 --> 11:23.733
It was due
to come down next week.
本来是由于
下周下来。

11:23.800 --> 11:26.933
- Ah! Spongy Spongy is free!
- 啊！海绵宝宝是免费的！

11:27.067 --> 11:28.733
- [grunts]
Spongy Spongy.
- [咕哝]
海绵状的 海绵状的。

11:28.800 --> 11:30.200
Spongy Spongy!
海绵海绵！

11:30.267 --> 11:33.600
- And so, the savage beast
finally soothed,
- 所以，野蛮的野兽
终于平静下来

11:33.667 --> 11:36.600
life in Bikini Bottom
returns to normal...
比基尼泳裤的生活
恢复正常...

11:36.667 --> 11:38.933
if only for this episode.
如果只是为了这一集。

11:39.067 --> 11:40.400
This is Perch Perkins--
这是珀奇·帕金斯——

11:40.467 --> 11:41.800
Ow!
- [grunts]
噢！
- [咕哝]

11:41.867 --> 11:44.167
- [groaning]
For Bikini Bottom News.
- [呻吟]
比基尼泳裤新闻。

11:44.233 --> 11:45.433
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

11:45.500 --> 11:46.433
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:46.500 --> 11:49.233
* *
**
**
**

